1
00:00:00,344 --> 00:00:03,374
- I'm sorry to hear about your troubles.
- Uh, thanks.

2
00:00:03,614 --> 00:00:08,314
(Penny:)But if you don't mind me asking, uh,
the potato clock, how does it work?

3
00:00:09,653 --> 00:00:13,183
(Penny:)Is it a trick clock or a trick potato?

4
00:00:18,195 --> 00:00:21,025
(Arthur:)What do you two talk about?

5
00:00:27,371 --> 00:00:30,861
(Sheldon:)I wrote a fan letter to you
when I was a child in Texas...

6
00:00:31,242 --> 00:00:36,182
(Sheldon:)...and you sent this autographed picture
back to me.

7
00:00:36,380 --> 00:00:37,870
(Sheldon:)Do you remember that?

8
00:00:38,883 --> 00:00:44,113
(Arthur:)I'll give you a hint. I have a bracelet
with my own address on it.

9
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:49,890
(Sheldon:)Well, anyway, um,
you may find this hard to believe...

10
00:00:50,127 --> 00:00:53,067
(Sheldon:)...but I didn't have any friends growing up.

11
00:00:54,565 --> 00:00:59,025
No, I get that.

